+# Research
+- Decision: unescape tokens with `~1`→`/` then `~0`→`~` (RFC 6901 §4 order), after validating that every `~` is followed by 0 or 1.
+- Decision: own-property check via `Object.hasOwn`; arrays accept only `/^(0|[1-9][0-9]*)$/` indexes below length.
